{"title":"Line segment","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>A <b>line segment</b> is a straight, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Finite\" title=\"Finite\">finite</a>, one-<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Dimension\" title=\"Dimension\">dimensional</a> figure which has no thickness.  Line segments are specified by their two endpoints.  The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Length\" title=\"Length\">length</a> of a line segment is the distance between the two endpoints.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Line_segment&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry\" title=\"Geometry\">Geometry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Planar_figure\" title=\"Planar figure\">Planar figure</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Line_segment&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018093241\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 12/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 277/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.052      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    7.052      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3645:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018093241 and 